      "blocks": {
        "image_with_text_q9VQce": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Blank_Poster_2000x2000_10_Memorial_Day_Landing_Page-min_23454d3e-bdd7-47d1-b31e-d041b60459d4.jpg",
            "title": "THE FOUR TOAST SALUTE",
            "text": "<p>Since the very beginning, we at Grunt Style have always stood for Honoring our Country and Military. Early on we came up with the 'Four Toast Salute,' a toast made by Veterans to honor what they stand for. This is a private, internal tradition we perform every Friday before going home to our families.</p>",
            "link_label": "Learn More",
            "link": "https://americangrit.com/post/4-toast-salute"
          }
        },
        "image_with_text_xTdby7": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Blank_Poster_2000x2000_9_Memorial_Day_Landing_Page-min.jpg",
            "title": "THE HISTORY OF THE BATTLEFIELD",
            "text": "<p>The Battlefield Cross is a symbolic replacement of a cross on the battlefield or at the base camp for a soldier who has been killed. In this article we explain how the cross is made up of the soldier's helmet, bayonet, and boots, placed on top of a symbolic representation of the fallen soldier's rifle.</p>",
            "link_label": "Learn More",
            "link": "https://americangrit.com/post/significance-of-the-battlefield-cross"
          }
        },
        "image_with_text_NX4ki6": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Blank_Poster_2000x2000_12_Memorial_Day_Landing_Page-min.jpg",
            "title": "CHILDREN OF FALLEN PATRIOTS",
            "text": "<p>Their mission is to provide college scholarships and educational counseling to military children who have lost a parent in the line of duty. Read more how you can help the children of our fallen patriots.</p>",
            "link_label": "Learn More",
            "link": "https://americangrit.com/post/honoring-our-heroes-legacy-college-scholarships-for-military-children"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
